            <physDesc xml:id="physDesc_663bf921">
               <titlePage label="" xml:id="titlePage_4e4621de">
                  <p xml:id="idm34">Quartetto / per / Due Violini, Viola &amp; Violoncello / composta dal / Sign: Niels W. Gade / (Øvelsesstykke !!! / <rend xml:id="idm35" rend="underline">1863</rend>. NWGade) / Compon. in Jan &amp; Februar - / <rend xml:id="idm36" rend="underline">1851</rend>
                  </p>
               </titlePage>
               <extent xml:id="extent_492bf92b">22 pages</extent>
               <dimensions unit="cm" xml:id="dimensions_e4899215">34 x 29</dimensions>
               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_f5dbb986">In hard binding with brown paper sides and brown leather spine. In upper left-hand corner a handwritten label inscribed: "Niels W. Gade: / Quartetto per 2 violine, / viola &amp; violoncello. / (Øvelsesstykke)". Written in ink. Paper: 20 staves. Verso of title page blank. Paginated from second music page 2-21. Last page blank. Heading on first music page: "1851" written in pencil in foreign hand. At the end of the first movement on p. 7 dated "Januar 51." The tempo indication of the second movement corrected from "Andantino con moto" to "Allegretto" and the first fifteen bars cancelled. At the end of the second movement dated: "Jan. 1851." and Gade's musical signature. At the end of the final movement Gade has written: "Fine 24 Febr. 51" and Gade's musical signature. Below added in pencil in a foreign hand: "24 Decbr. 1851." which is incorrect.</physMedium>
            </physDesc>
